---
title: "keepAlive (stem-bot-v2: src/utils/keepalive.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: INTERVAL = 6 hours
    q_init --> q_first: performKeepAlive() immediate
    q_first --> q_schedule: setInterval(performKeepAlive, INTERVAL)
    q_schedule --> q_wait: waiting for interval
    q_wait --> q_query: supabase.from("teams").select("*", count = "exact", head = true)
    q_query --> q_log_ok: count returned
    q_query --> q_log_err: query error
    q_log_ok --> q_wait: log success
    q_log_err --> q_wait: log error, continue

    note right of q_query
        INV-001: Keep-alive runs every 6 hours to prevent Supabase archiving
        INV-002: Lightweight query (head = true, no row data)
        INV-003: Errors do not stop the interval
    end note
